Date:   Sun Nov 15 22:53:40 2026 -0300

    Show Q&A history as a multi-turn conversation in the question panel

    - New ConversationView replaces the single lastResponse block: all exchanges
      oldest-first with You/Assistant turns, full answers, readable timestamps,
      confidence, and citations (title, chunk, excerpt) as buttons that open the
      cited document; stale citations show a notice instead of failing.
    - Pending turn with 'Answering…' and a ref guard against double submit;
      persisted history replaces the optimistic turn in one render.
    - Inline error turn with Retry/Dismiss; earlier exchanges stay visible.
    - Empty and loading states, in-page Clear confirmation via qa.clearHistory(),
      auto-scroll to the newest exchange.
    - Accessibility: role=log/aria-live, ol/li/article, labelled input,
      :focus-visible outline.
    - Sidebar History tab and ConversationHistory.tsx removed (lossy duplicate).
    - Display helpers in conversation-format.ts with vitest unit tests.
